# Bound the Docker build context for the investigator image. The CDK asset
# builds from `investigator/` (cdk/lib/investigator-stack.ts), so everything
# here is relative to that dir. Excluding build artifacts keeps the context —
# and the `COPY . /opt/platform-src` platform-graph bake — small and fast.
#
# NOTE: do NOT exclude .npmrc — the Dockerfile bind-mounts it for `npm install`
# (CI writes it into the context before `cdk deploy`; local dev drops one in).

node_modules
**/node_modules

# Python caches / test artifacts
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.code-review-graph

# Spike scaffolding — not part of the runtime image
docker/spike-pydeps.Dockerfile
docker/spike-mcp-smoke.sh

# Local-only / VCS noise
.git
.gitignore
*.log
.DS_Store
